JDepend Maven Plugin
====================

This plugin produces a nicely formatted metrics report based on your project.

This plugin uses [JDepend](https://github.com/nidi3/jdepend) in version ${jdependVersion}, a fork of
[the original JDepend](https://github.com/clarkware/jdepend) that reads current class files.

Goals Overview
--------------

- [jdepend:generate](./generate-mojo.html) Run JDepend and generate a site report.
- [jdepend:generate-no-fork](./generate-no-fork-mojo.html) Run JDepend and generate a site report (without forking the life cycle).
- [jdepend:check](./check-mojo.html) Check compiled classes for package dependency cycles and fail the build when a cycle is found.

See the [cycle check page](./check.html) for build-time package cycle enforcement.

Usage
-----

Instructions on how to use the JDepend Maven Plugin can be found on the [usage page](./usage.html).

